mediatek-neuropilot (6.0+genio23.1~pr1-0genio1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Ubuntu: Add debian control files for NeuroPilot 6.0 prebuilt
    binaries and header files for Genio platform. 
    
  * Prebuilt binaries provides offline compilers
    and runtime libraries for hardware accelerated machine learning
    model inference.

  * These binaries are built for Genio IoT Yocto v23.1 and is 
    also compatible to Genio Ubuntu. 
  
  * These prebuilt libraries links to clang C++ runtime.

